  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TTMF - Residential Warehousing Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a warehousing facility for up to TTD300 million Trinidadian Dollars (&#x201c;TTD&#x201d;), equivalent to approximately US$44 million and for up to nine years, to promote affordable residential mortgage financing in Trinidad and Tobago. The transaction features a potential exit to local capital market in the form of mortgage-backed security. The use of funds will support TTMF focus on providing affordable residential mortgage financing in Trinidad and Tobago. As a non-deposit taking institution, TTMF relies primarily on intermediate tenor loans and debt capital markets instruments to fund its lending operations.</narrative>
  </description>
